  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 8.2(a), the AHP model as built in SuperDecisions. A screenshot of the application's main window, titled \"Super Decisions Main Window: AHP.sdmod\", with its menu bar (File, Design, Assess/Compare, Computations, Networks, Help) and toolbar visible. Three cluster windows are stacked and joined by downward arrows: L1-Goal holding one node \"Goal_Node\"; L2-Criteria holding C1, C2 and C3; and L3-Alternatives holding A1 to A4. It is the worked example's concrete instance of Figure 8.1 — three criteria and four alternatives.",
